OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-stricken swan released after
OL,4,Arock rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swan rescued after becoming trapped
OL,7,Fin rocks on a beach during Storm Austen
OL,8,Fhas been released back into the wild.
OL,10,FThe bird was spotted on Barton on Sea
OL,11,Fbeach on Friday afternoon trapped in a
OL,12,Fsmall gap in a cluster of large rocks
OL,13,Fclose to the sea's edge by passers-by
OL,14,Fwho alerted the RSPCA.
OL,16,FRSPCA inspector Jo Story climbed among
OL,17,Fthe rocks to reach the male swan where
OL,18,Fshe said after "carefully folding his
OL,19,Fwing in to his chest" she was able to
OL,20,Fpull him free.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
