OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-stricken swan released after
OL,4,Arock rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was taken to Bournemouth-based
OL,7,Fcharity Wildlife in Need where he
OL,8,Fstayed to be checked over. After being
OL,9,Ffound to be healthy and cleared to
OL,10,Freturn to the wild he was released at
OL,11,FChristchurch Town Quay on Wednesday
OL,12,Fmorning.
